text:
The dish looks like a salsa or pico de gallo made of diced tomato, red onion, cilantro, and some yellow pieces that may be mango or pineapple. It sits on a white plate that is roughly 22-24 cm across.

The food covers a patch about 11 by 12 cm and is probably 2-3 cm deep. That is roughly 150 g of food. Diced tomato salsa has about 30-40 kcal per 100 g, and the fruit pieces raise that slightly, so about 40 kcal per 100 g gives around 60 kcal.

